Intuition
Every possible combination of mouse position , cat position and turn will give us different states.Now we need to try every state,initially marked as draw. Now for some of these states we already know thier outcomes.If cat and mouse have same position then cat wins and if mouse reaches hole mouse wins. We will mark these states.Now let say we are in an arbitrary state.We will as many choices to proceed from there as many edges we have.Suppose we as a mouse take an edge that leads us to a state where cat wins then we cannot choose this path(both plays optimally).Now we have 1 less choice.Similarly if every choice leads to cat win then this state is definitely a cat win.Similarly for mouse win.If even one choice give us mouse win then that state has atleast one possible way to have mouse win thats why we update that state as mouse win.

